  "description": {
    "text": "The 2009 Pokémon World Championships, held from 13 to 15 August 2009 at the Hilton San Diego Bayfront. Competitors got the last Tropical Wind in seven languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Finalist. Part of the print run carries the 2008 card's number, DP25, instead of DP48. Japan picked its players at a new World Championship Representative Tournament.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards.",
